# Film 3 of still.fail in use on the iPhone Duo simulator, in English: a station's screen watched live as the agent
# works on it (story scripts/story/iduo-screen-en.json, FILM_LANG=en FILM_STORY=iduo-screen-en; its frames made by
# screen_frames.mjs).
timeout 45000
until Message
# (the film once the app is on the screen as it stays: its first frames, as it starts, are none of the story)
wait 1200
at start
wait 1500
# (the list open over the chat as the outer screen lights: the chat tapped where it shows at the right, the list goes)
at tap=chat
tapxy 430 330
wait 1500
at unfold
log UNFOLD
wait 4500
at card
tap Checkout - localhost:5173
wait 1500
at screen
wait 7600
at back
tap icon:close
wait 1500
at tap=发消息
tap Message
wait 600
at keys
keys Fix it
wait 600
at tap=send
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 400
at kb-down
# (the keyboard left up as one does after sending: no tap on the list to put it away)
wait 500
at working
until Fixed:
at fixed
wait 2000
# (the card under the composer with the keyboard up: the chat pushed up a little to bring it over it)
at scroll
drag 560 230 0 -160 450
wait 700
at tap=合并
tap =Merge
until 9d41b7e
at merged
wait 3200
at end
exit
